# Gita Grove authoring (always allow)

Pre-approved Grove v2 work. Do **not** ask for confirmation before drafting unless user says stop.

## Git / branches

- **`main` is production** — Grove work on **`feature/gita-grove`** only
- Prefer **`gita-grove-authoring`** repo for validate/compile/sync

## Before drafting

1. Read `docs/gita-grove/module-registry.json` and `docs/gita-grove/module-bibles/{adventureId}.md`
2. Use **6-skill pipeline** (`gita-grove-deliver-module`)
3. Human cast only — **no animal protagonists, no Guru Ma Owl**

## Defaults

- English-first · adventure first → śloka later
- Remember = **book voice** (`rememberLine`) — not a character speaking
- One lead + one supporting per module · never all six
- Never run `gita:seed-authored-stories` or `gita:build-themes-auto`

## After each manuscript

- Save to `docs/books/gv{book}_a{adv}-{slug}.md` + `*.story.json`
- Update `scripts/data/gita-grove-curriculum.json`
- Sync from gita-grove-authoring when ready

## ID pattern

`gv{book}_a{adv}` · **74 modules**
